{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "diagram_type": "workflow",
  "meta": {
    "title": "F14 — Chat per Order",
    "quality_profile": "showcase"
  },
  "lanes": [
    {
      "id": "chat",
      "label": "Layar chat (app)"
    },
    {
      "id": "pesan",
      "label": "Daftar chat & status pesan"
    },
    {
      "id": "guard",
      "label": "Guard tampilan",
      "variant": "exception"
    }
  ],
  "phases": [
    {
      "id": "buat",
      "label": "Thread & pesan",
      "fromCol": 0,
      "toCol": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "kirim",
      "label": "Kirim, receipt & arsip",
      "fromCol": 3,
      "toCol": 5,
      "variant": "emphasis"
    }
  ],
  "mainPath": [
    "placed",
    "thread",
    "message",
    "delivery",
    "readreceipt",
    "archive"
  ],
  "semanticChecks": {
    "allowedRoots": [
      "placed",
      "courierjoin",
      "access"
    ],
    "allowedTerminals": [
      "archive",
      "dispute",
      "reject"
    ],
    "requiredEdges": [
      {
        "from": "placed",
        "to": "thread"
      },
      {
        "from": "thread",
        "to": "message"
      },
      {
        "from": "message",
        "to": "delivery"
      },
      {
        "from": "delivery",
        "to": "readreceipt"
      },
      {
        "from": "readreceipt",
        "to": "archive"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "placed",
      "lane": "chat",
      "col": 0,
      "type": "frontend",
      "label": "Order placed",
      "sublabel": "buka dari layar order",
      "width": 124
    },
    {
      "id": "courierjoin",
      "lane": "chat",
      "col": 2,
      "type": "frontend",
      "label": "Kurir masuk thread",
      "sublabel": "event courier_match",
      "width": 130
    },
    {
      "id": "retry",
      "lane": "chat",
      "col": 3,
      "type": "frontend",
      "label": "Gagal kirim",
      "sublabel": "retry manual / otomatis",
      "width": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "thread",
      "lane": "pesan",
      "col": 1,
      "type": "frontend",
      "label": "Daftar chat",
      "sublabel": "orderId · ≤3 peserta",
      "width": 132
    },
    {
      "id": "message",
      "lane": "pesan",
      "col": 2,
      "type": "frontend",
      "label": "Tulis pesan",
      "sublabel": "sender · body · at",
      "width": 116
    },
    {
      "id": "delivery",
      "lane": "pesan",
      "col": 3,
      "type": "frontend",
      "label": "Pesan terkirim",
      "sublabel": "status di bubble",
      "width": 110
    },
    {
      "id": "readreceipt",
      "lane": "pesan",
      "col": 4,
      "type": "frontend",
      "label": "Dibaca",
      "sublabel": "readAt · badge",
      "width": 104
    },
    {
      "id": "archive",
      "lane": "pesan",
      "col": 5,
      "type": "frontend",
      "label": "Chat read-only",
      "sublabel": "done + N hari",
      "tag": "closed",
      "width": 130
    },
    {
      "id": "access",
      "lane": "guard",
      "col": 2,
      "type": "security",
      "label": "Peserta saja",
      "sublabel": "≤3 peserta",
      "width": 128
    },
    {
      "id": "dispute",
      "lane": "guard",
      "col": 0,
      "type": "security",
      "label": "Thread priority",
      "sublabel": "flag dispute_opened",
      "tag": "priority",
      "width": 126
    },
    {
      "id": "reject",
      "lane": "guard",
      "col": 3,
      "type": "security",
      "label": "Pesan ditolak",
      "sublabel": "rate limit / abuse",
      "tag": "blocked",
      "width": 120
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e-place",
      "from": "placed",
      "to": "thread",
      "label": "order placed",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-write",
      "from": "thread",
      "to": "message",
      "label": "tulis pesan",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-send",
      "from": "message",
      "to": "delivery",
      "label": "kirim",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-read",
      "from": "delivery",
      "to": "readreceipt",
      "label": "dibaca → readAt",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-archive",
      "from": "readreceipt",
      "to": "archive",
      "label": "order done + N hari",
      "role": "main",
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-courier",
      "from": "courierjoin",
      "to": "thread",
      "label": "courier_match → courier masuk",
      "role": "branch"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-access",
      "from": "access",
      "to": "message",
      "label": "guard: peserta lolos ≤3",
      "role": "branch",
      "variant": "security",
      "route": "drop",
      "fromSide": "top",
      "toSide": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-dispute",
      "from": "thread",
      "to": "dispute",
      "label": "dispute_opened → priority (F8)",
      "role": "branch",
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-retry-out",
      "from": "message",
      "to": "retry",
      "label": "gagal kirim",
      "role": "branch"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-retry-in",
      "from": "retry",
      "to": "delivery",
      "label": "retry terkirim",
      "role": "branch"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-reject",
      "from": "message",
      "to": "reject",
      "label": "melebihi limit / abuse",
      "role": "branch",
      "variant": "security"
    }
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Thread & pesan",
      "items": [
        "Chat dibuka dari layar order (schema `chat`: orderId, peserta customer/merchant/kurir, maks 3) — di repo ini layar mock, pesan tidak benar-benar terkirim (AGENTS.md §1)",
        "Bubble pesan: sender, body (string), at · readAt = badge dibaca · lastMessage/lastAt = preview daftar",
        "Buka dari layar order; peserta penuh setelah event courier_match (sambungan f12→f13)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Branch & guard",
      "items": [
        "Pesan gagal kirim → retry; courier belum match → thread 2 peserta dulu, courier masuk saat courier_match",
        "Dispute (F8) membuka thread priority — flag dispute_opened pada thread",
        "Guard tampilan: hanya peserta (≤3) yang melihat thread; rate limit/abuse → pesan tampil ditolak"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Sumber & UNRESOLVED",
      "items": [
        "Dasar: `C-18` (in-app chat dipertahankan) + `C-12` (dispute jalur terpisah) · schema-draft-v1.md entri 14 hanya nama field · PRD irbid-mvp-v2-2026-09-21 · repo ini front-end saja: layar chat = tampilan mock (AGENTS.md §1)",
        "UNRESOLVED: retensi chat setelah order done — N hari archiving belum ditentukan PRD",
        "UNRESOLVED: media/gambar message (schema hanya body: string) · notifikasi push incoming chat (F11 ada, belum dipastikan)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}